 "note": "Twelve pictures side by side, one seamless strip, walked left to right like the crash sequence: the garage, the ride into the city, the bank, the box, the call, the office. Chased (Ethel_chased_After_Crash, six seamless backgrounds) goes in after the city view: 01 and 05 have two scenes each, 06 two shots blending its lettered layers (06A, 06B, then 06C, 06D, 06E). What Ethel saw (2019-03-02_what-ethel-saw) plays by itself, once per visit, when the visitor goes on from The box (\"sequence\" on that stop; \"rest\" lands every gesture on it first), then it lands on The evidence remains (Ethel_The_Evidence_Remains), after which The call and The office follow as before. Subtle_loop (audio/What_Ethel_Saw) fades in on The bank and loops on the beat through The box; What Ethel saw takes over from it on a bar line, and hands back to it at its end, held on The evidence remains until the visitor swipes on (\"loop\" on those stops; see world.js, a beat loop).",
